# No .env needed for pure frontend static build.
# Paste your TypeSafe AI key in the browser (key icon) or set a direct brain URL.
# The key is stored in localStorage and sent directly from the browser to api.typesafe.ai.
# No server, no OAuth, no credits gate.
#
# Optional: route Jev calls through a relay (same-origin, so no CORS preflight).
# Dev defaults to the Vite proxy (/typesafe/* -> api.typesafe.ai) automatically.
# For a GitHub Pages build, deploy workers/jev-relay.js once and set:
# VITE_JEV_ENDPOINT=https://jev-relay.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/v1/systemone
